// NOTE: the loan was made in 2025 and the book begins in 2026, so the 11 payments before it are not in the book. Nothing opens the debt, and the terms say what is owed: `check` says what it opened and how to say another number.
base USD
use std

entity bank : lender
account checking : bank
asset condo : property

opening 2026-01-01
  checking 900_000 USD

contract mortgage with bank
  loan 120_000 USD on 2025-01-15 at 6% over 3y for condo
  monthly on 1 from checking
  from 2025-02-01

2026-01-01 mortgage
